---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  titleOverride="Duplex Construction Company in Lucknow | VP Infra"
  description="VP Infra builds quality duplex homes in Lucknow with expert design, ISO-certified construction & transparent pricing. Start your duplex project today. Call 8840069902."
>
  <section class="page-header text-center" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.82), rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.82)), url('/images/duplex_construction_lucknow.webp');">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="fade-in-up">Duplex Construction Company in Lucknow</h1>
      <p class="fade-in-up mt-4">Two homes. One plot. Maximum value from your land investment in Lucknow.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-details">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid gap-8 service-grid">
        <div class="service-content fade-in-up">
          <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Duplex Homes Designed for Lucknow Families</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">A duplex is one of the smartest decisions many Lucknow families can make with a medium or large residential plot. You get two self-contained homes on one piece of land. Live in one, rent out the other — or house two generations of your family with complete privacy between them. VP Infra has built duplexes across Lucknow for families who want more from their plot than a single home can deliver.</p>
          <p class="mb-4">As a dedicated duplex construction company in Lucknow, we understand the specific design challenges a duplex presents. The two units must share structural elements while remaining fully independent in terms of entry, utilities, and day-to-day privacy. Getting this balance right in the design phase saves significant rework and cost during construction.</p>

          <h3 class="mt-8 mb-4">Types of Duplex Homes We Build</h3>
          <ul class="benefits-list">
            <li><strong>Side-by-Side Duplex (Twin Units):</strong> Both units on ground level sharing a common boundary wall. Each has its own entrance from the street. Best suited for corner plots or wide plots with 40 feet or more frontage.</li>
            <li><strong>Stacked Duplex (G+1):</strong> One unit on the ground floor, the other on the first floor with separate staircases and independent entrance doors. Works well on narrower plots.</li>
            <li><strong>Owner and Rental Unit Configuration:</strong> Ground floor designed for owner occupation with better finishes. First floor designed for rental with standard finishing to keep construction cost efficient.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="mt-8 mb-4">What Sets VP Infra's Duplex Construction Apart</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">The most common complaint about duplex construction is sound transfer between units. VP Infra addresses this at the structural stage with AAC block masonry for party walls, which offers better acoustic and thermal performance than traditional brick. For stacked duplexes, gypsum board ceiling systems with acoustic batt insulation are installed between floors.</p>
          <p class="mb-4">We also work through shared infrastructure decisions early — water tank placement, electricity meter points, shared boundary wall responsibility, and roof drainage are all agreed in writing before construction begins. Both unit owners have full clarity before a single brick is laid.</p>

          <h3 class="mt-8 mb-4">The VP Infra Duplex Process</h3>
          <ul class="benefits-list">
            <li><strong>Site Assessment and Feasibility:</strong> We evaluate your plot for duplex feasibility — dimensions, frontage, setback requirements, and FAR limits under LDA rules.</li>
            <li><strong>Dual-Unit Architectural Design:</strong> Floor plans for both units created simultaneously with independent entry points and optimised shared structural elements.</li>
            <li><strong>LDA Building Permission:</strong> Building plan submitted showing both units and compliance with Lucknow's residential duplex norms under UP Building Byelaws.</li>
            <li><strong>Supervised Construction:</strong> Foundation to finishing with a dedicated site engineer and twice-weekly client updates via WhatsApp photos.</li>
            <li><strong>Separate Utility Connections:</strong> We assist with applications for individual electricity meters and water connections for each unit at handover.</li>
          </ul>

          <div class="internal-links-section mt-8">
            <p>More from VP Infra's construction services:</p>
            <ul class="related-links">
              <li><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-lucknow/">Building construction company in Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/services/residential-construction-services-in-lucknow/">Residential construction services in Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/services/turnkey-building-contractors-in-lucknow/">Turnkey building contractors in Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/services/custom-home-builders-in-ashiyana-lucknow/">Custom home builders in Ashiyana, Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/services/commercial-construction-company-in-lucknow/">Commercial construction company in Lucknow</a></li>
              <li><a href="/about-us/">About VP Infra</a></li>
              <li><a href="/contact-us/">Contact us for a duplex estimate</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-8"><a href="/contact-us/" class="btn btn-primary">Get a Duplex Construction Quote</a></div>
        </div>

        <div class="service-image fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
          <img src="/images/duplex_construction_lucknow.webp" alt="Duplex Construction Company in Lucknow — completed duplex home with Indian family" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Everything You Need to Know -->
  <section class="know-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="know-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">Everything You Need to Know</h2>
        <p class="know-subtitle">Key facts about duplex construction in Lucknow — plot rules, loan eligibility, timelines, and sound-proofing between units.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="know-stats">
        <div class="know-stat"><span class="know-stat-value">12–16</span><span class="know-stat-desc">Months, G+1 duplex</span></div>
        <div class="know-stat"><span class="know-stat-value">90 sq yd</span><span class="know-stat-desc">Min. plot for 2 BHK each</span></div>
        <div class="know-stat"><span class="know-stat-value">LDA</span><span class="know-stat-desc">Approved layout compliant</span></div>
        <div class="know-stat"><span class="know-stat-value">2</span><span class="know-stat-desc">Independent utility meters</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="know-grid">
        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">🏘️</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Duplex vs Double-Storey</h3>
            <p>A duplex contains two self-contained residential units on the same plot, each with its own entrance, kitchen, bathrooms, and utility connections. A double-storey house is a single residence spread across two floors with shared access throughout. The key distinction is independent occupancy — in a duplex, two separate families live completely independently from each other.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">📐</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Minimum Plot Size Rules</h3>
            <p>The minimum plot size for a meaningful stacked duplex with two usable 2BHK units in Lucknow is generally 90 sq yards. On smaller plots of 60 to 80 sq yards, a duplex is technically possible but individual unit sizes will be compact at around 350 to 450 sq ft each. VP Infra recommends a site consultation to confirm what configuration delivers the best livable outcome on your specific plot.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">🔇</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Acoustic Separation Between Units</h3>
            <p>Sound transfer between duplex units is one of the most common problems in poorly built duplexes. VP Infra uses AAC block masonry for party walls, which offers superior acoustic performance over traditional brick. For stacked duplexes, gypsum board ceiling systems with acoustic batt insulation are installed between floors to reduce airborne and impact sound transmission.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">💡</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Separate Utilities for Each Unit</h3>
            <p>Each duplex unit in Lucknow can have a separate electricity meter from LESA and a separate water connection from Lucknow Jal Kal filed under individual occupant names. VP Infra plans and installs separate conduits and plumbing branches to each unit during construction so that independent meter and connection applications at handover are straightforward with no retrofitting required.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card">
          <div class="know-icon">🏦</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Home Loans for Duplex Projects</h3>
            <p>Most major banks including SBI, HDFC, ICICI, and Axis Bank provide construction loans for duplex projects in Lucknow, subject to an LDA-approved building plan and verified land ownership. The loan is disbursed in stages linked to construction milestones. VP Infra provides all documents required for loan sanction including the construction agreement, project schedule, and cost estimate.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="know-card know-card-highlight">
          <div class="know-icon">🗓️</div>
          <div class="know-card-body">
            <h3>Construction Timelines</h3>
            <p>A standard stacked duplex of 2,500 to 3,000 sq ft total in Lucknow takes 12 to 16 months from LDA building permission to final handover. A side-by-side duplex of similar total area takes 14 to 18 months due to the wider footprint. VP Infra provides a month-by-month schedule at contract signing. For more on residential builds, see our <a href="/services/residential-construction-services-in-lucknow/">residential construction services in Lucknow</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="faq-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title text-center mb-8">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>What is a duplex house and how is it different from a double-storey house?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>A duplex house contains two self-contained residential units on the same plot, each with its own entrance, kitchen, bathrooms, and utilities. A double-storey house is a single residence spread across two floors with shared access. In a duplex, two separate families live completely independently. A double-storey home is one household across two levels.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Can I build a duplex on a 100 sq yard plot in Lucknow?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes, a stacked duplex with separate entrances is feasible on a 100 sq yard plot in Lucknow, subject to LDA setback requirements. After mandatory setbacks, the usable footprint is typically 55 to 65 sq yards per floor, giving each unit roughly 500 to 600 sq ft — adequate for a 2BHK layout. VP Infra confirms feasibility after a site visit before any design work begins.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>How do I divide utilities between duplex units?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Each duplex unit can have a separate LESA electricity meter and a separate Lucknow Jal Kal water connection filed under individual names. VP Infra plans the utility infrastructure during construction by running separate conduits and plumbing branches to each unit, so that independent meter and connection applications at handover are straightforward.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Can I get a home loan for duplex construction in Lucknow?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. Most major banks including SBI, HDFC, ICICI, and Axis Bank provide construction loans for duplex projects in Lucknow, subject to an LDA-approved building plan and verified land ownership. VP Infra provides the construction agreement, project schedule, and cost estimate documents that banks require for loan sanction and disbursement.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Is duplex construction allowed in LDA approved colonies in Lucknow?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Duplex construction is permitted in residential zones under LDA-approved layouts, subject to the plot's zoning classification and compliance with UP Building Byelaws 2026. Key restrictions include 60% maximum ground coverage, setback requirements on all four sides, maximum FAR limits, and height restrictions. VP Infra evaluates these parameters at the site assessment stage before any design begins.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Which is the best duplex construction company in Lucknow?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>VP Infra Properties (OPC) Pvt. Ltd. is a well-established duplex construction company in Lucknow with ISO 9001:2015 certification and MSME registration. Key strengths include acoustic party wall design, independent utility planning from the design stage, LDA approval management, and milestone-based payment terms. Contact them on 8840069902 or through the <a href="/contact-us/">website contact form</a>.</p></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section text-center">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Build Your Duplex in Lucknow with VP Infra</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 mb-8">Get more from your plot. Let VP Infra design and build your duplex home in Lucknow with full transparency and construction that lasts for decades.</p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="/contact-us/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get a Duplex Estimate</a>
        <a href="tel:8840069902" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Call: 8840069902</a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm">Also explore our <a href="/services/residential-construction-services-in-lucknow/">residential construction services in Lucknow</a> for single-family home projects.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header { background-size: cover; background-position: center; color: var(--text-light); padding: 8rem 0 6rem; }
  .page-header h1 { color: var(--text-light); font-size: 3.5rem; }
  .service-grid { grid-template-columns: 3fr 2fr; align-items: start; padding: 4rem 0; }
  @media (max-width: 992px) { .service-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .page-header h1 { font-size: 2.4rem; } }
  .service-image img { width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }
  .benefits-list { list-style: none; }
  .benefits-list li { position: relative; padding-left: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--text-gray); }
  .benefits-list li::before { content: '🏘️'; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; }
  .benefits-list strong { color: var(--secondary); }
  .related-links { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .related-links li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .related-links a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline; }
  .internal-links-section { border-top: 1px solid #e0e7f0; padding-top: 1.5rem; }
  .internal-links-section p { font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-dark); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .know-section { padding: 5rem 0; background: #f4f7fb; }
  .know-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .know-subtitle { color: var(--text-gray); font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 0.6rem; max-width: 600px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
  .know-stats { display: flex; justify-content: center; background: var(--primary); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .know-stat { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding: 1.4rem 1rem; border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }
  .know-stat:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .know-stat-value { font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif; }
  .know-stat-desc { font-size: 0.78rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72); margin-top: 0.2rem; text-align: center; }
  .know-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .know-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .know-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .know-stats { flex-wrap: wrap; } .know-stat { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); flex: 1 1 45%; } }
  .know-card { background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.8rem 1.6rem; display: flex; gap: 1.1rem; box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-left: 3px solid var(--primary); transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease; }
  .know-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.11); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .know-card-highlight { border-left-color: var(--secondary); background: #fffaf4; }
  .know-icon { font-size: 1.7rem; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1; margin-top: 0.1rem; }
  .know-card-body h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.55rem; }
  .know-card-body p { font-size: 0.93rem; color: var(--text-gray); line-height: 1.72; margin: 0; }
  .know-card-body a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline; }
  .faq-section { padding: 4rem 0; background: #fff; }
  .faq-list { max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .faq-item { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e0e7f0; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 1rem; overflow: hidden; }
  .faq-item summary { padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; color: var(--primary); list-style: none; }
  .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .faq-answer { padding: 0 1.5rem 1.2rem; color: var(--text-gray); line-height: 1.75; }
  .cta-section { padding: 5rem 0; background: var(--primary); color: #fff; }
  .cta-section h2 { color: #fff; font-size: 2.2rem; }
  .cta-section p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .cta-buttons { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-lg { padding: 1rem 2.2rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .btn-secondary { background: transparent; border: 2px solid #fff; color: #fff; }
  .cta-section .text-sm a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); }
</style>
